   "text": "THE 4096-TOKEN WINDOW (SystemLanguageModel.contextSize; everything counts)\n\u2502 Instructions \u2502 Tool definitions (schema digests) \u2502 \u27e6memory\u27e7 block (\u22643\u00d7240ch) \u2502 conversation history \u2502 streaming reply \u2502 reserved for reply: 512 \u2502\nBudget lines rendered in the Tokens tab; 'Where tokens go' breakdown buckets: Instructions / Tools / Memory / History",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "win",
   "originalText": "THE 4096-TOKEN WINDOW (SystemLanguageModel.contextSize; everything counts)\n\u2502 Instructions \u2502 Tool definitions (schema digests) \u2502 \u27e6memory\u27e7 block (\u22643\u00d7240ch) \u2502 conversation history \u2502 streaming reply \u2502 reserved for reply: 512 \u2502\nBudget lines rendered in the Tokens tab; 'Where tokens go' breakdown buckets: Instructions / Tools / Memory / History",
